{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39412","headline":"长门怨二首 一 · 王贞白","name":"长门怨二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"寂寞故宫春，残灯晓尚存。\n从来非妾过，偶尔失君恩。\n花落伤容鬓，莺啼惊梦魂。\n翠华如可待，应免老长门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王贞白","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_39412.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_39412","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}